            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "All right. Now it's time to tackle the worst of all - Loother Ray and the Fangs gang. They're the ones who now occupy the Palace.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_24.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When they took the palace, the Fangs also stole the Tablet of Han'il, an ancient Purrzian artifact that belongs in a museum.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_25.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Undoubtedly, they are keeping the Tablet in the Palace Treasure Vault. What they don't realize is that the vault has a secret entrance.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_26.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-AGGR-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Go with Istar to the Arcades District and find the Vault's secret entrance. Go in, get the Tablet, and leave evidence that the Ferals were there.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_SultanaF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SultanaSharzad_MIR_27.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381236,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
